  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JHNP Joint Health &amp; Nutrition Program Somalia - JHNP Joint Health Program Soma</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JHNP Joint Health &amp; Nutrition Program Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN i samarbete med Somalia Statliga myndigheter l&#xe4;mnade kommitt&#xe9;n h&#xe4;lsosektorn samordnings en beg&#xe4;ran om att st&#xf6;dja gemensamma h&#xe4;lsa och nutrition program f&#xf6;r Somalia. Programmet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra m&#xf6;drars Neonatal-och barnh&#xe4;lsa i de tre Somalia regionerna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN in collaboration with the Somalia Government Authorities, the Health Sector Coordination Committee submitted a request to support the Joint Health and Nutrition programme for Somalia. The programme is aimed at improving Maternal Neonatal and Child Health in the three Somalia regions.</narrative>
  </description>
